### 3. Design
- Professional "research profile" aesthetic with a green/earth-tone palette
- Google Fonts (Playfair Display + Inter)
- Responsive layout (mobile hamburger menu, grid breakpoints)
- CSS custom properties, smooth transitions, card hover effects
